window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-79239d17dd17d164"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"open-source\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">开源</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>OpenAI 以公开方式开发 Codex 的一些关键部分。相关工作托管在 GitHub 上，你可以在那里关注进展、报告问题并提出改进建议。</p> <p>如果你维护着一个广泛使用的开源项目，或希望提名负责维护重要项目的维护者，还可以<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/community/codex-for-oss.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">申请加入 Codex for OSS 计划（官方来源暂不可用）</a>，以获得 API 额度、带 Codex 的 ChatGPT Pro，以及按资格选择性开放的 Codex Security 访问权限。</p> <p><a id=\"open-source-components\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">开源组件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>组件</th> <th>获取位置</th> <th>说明</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Codex CLI</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex（需联网）</a></td> <td>Codex 开源开发的主要代码库</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex SDK</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/sdk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/codex-sdk（需联网）</a></td> <td>SDK 源代码位于 Codex 代码库中</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex Security CLI</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-security（需联网）</a></td> <td>用于发现并验证安全漏洞的 CLI</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex Security TypeScript SDK</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-security/tree/main/sdk/typescript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-security/sdk/typescript（需联网）</a></td> <td>用于运行 Codex Security 扫描的 TypeScript SDK</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex App Server</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/codex-rs/app-server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/codex-rs/app-server（需联网）</a></td> <td>App Server 源代码位于 Codex 代码库中</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Skills</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/skills（需联网）</a></td> <td>用于扩展 ChatGPT 和 Codex 的可复用技能</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Plugins</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/plugins（需联网）</a></td> <td>适用于 ChatGPT 和 Codex 的可复用插件</td> </tr> <tr> <td>IDE extension</td> <td>-</td> <td>未开源</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex cloud</td> <td>-</td> <td>未开源</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Universal cloud environment</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-universal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-universal（需联网）</a></td> <td>Codex 云端使用的基础环境</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"where-to-report-issues-and-request-features\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">在哪里报告问题和提出功能请求</h2> <p>请在对应的 GitHub 代码库中报告错误或提出功能请求：</p> <ul> <li>Codex 错误报告与功能请求：<a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/issues（需联网）</a></li> <li>Codex Security CLI 和 TypeScript SDK 的错误报告与功能请求：<a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-security/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-security/issues（需联网）</a></li> <li>讨论论坛：<a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/discussions（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p>提交 issue 时，请注明你使用的是哪个组件（CLI、SDK、IDE 扩展、Codex 云端或 Codex Security），并尽可能附上版本号。</p> <p><code>openai/codex</code> 仓库欢迎社区通过 issue 参与贡献，包括错误报告、复现步骤和根因分析；但不接受外部代码贡献或拉取请求。详情请查看其<a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/docs/contributing.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">贡献指南（需联网）</a>。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"open-source\">Open Source</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>OpenAI develops key parts of Codex in the open. That work lives on GitHub so you can follow progress, report issues, and request improvements.</p> <p>If you maintain a widely used open-source project or want to nominate maintainers stewarding important projects, you can also <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/community/codex-for-oss.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">apply to the Codex for OSS program (official source unavailable)</a> for API credits, ChatGPT Pro with Codex, and selective access to Codex Security.</p> <h2 id=\"open-source-components\">Open-source components</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Component</th> <th>Where to find</th> <th>Notes</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Codex CLI</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex (online)</a></td> <td>The primary home for Codex open-source development</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex SDK</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/sdk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/codex-sdk (online)</a></td> <td>SDK sources live in the Codex repo</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex Security CLI</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-security (online)</a></td> <td>CLI for finding and validating security vulnerabilities</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex Security TypeScript SDK</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-security/tree/main/sdk/typescript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-security/sdk/typescript (online)</a></td> <td>TypeScript SDK for running Codex Security scans</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex App Server</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/codex-rs/app-server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/codex-rs/app-server (online)</a></td> <td>App-server sources live in the Codex repo</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Skills</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/skills (online)</a></td> <td>Reusable skills that extend ChatGPT and Codex</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Plugins</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/plugins (online)</a></td> <td>Reusable plugins for ChatGPT and Codex</td> </tr> <tr> <td>IDE extension</td> <td>-</td> <td>Not open source</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Codex cloud</td> <td>-</td> <td>Not open source</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Universal cloud environment</td> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-universal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-universal (online)</a></td> <td>Base environment used by Codex cloud</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"where-to-report-issues-and-request-features\">Where to report issues and request features</h2> <p>Use the appropriate GitHub repository for bug reports and feature requests:</p> <ul> <li>Codex bug reports and feature requests: <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/issues (online)</a></li> <li>Codex Security CLI and TypeScript SDK bug reports and feature requests: <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-security/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex-security/issues (online)</a></li> <li>Discussion forum: <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai/codex/discussions (online)</a></li> </ul> <p>When you file an issue, include which component you are using (CLI, SDK, IDE extension, Codex cloud, or Codex Security) and the version where possible.</p> <p>The <code>openai/codex</code> repository accepts community contributions through issues, including bug reports, reproduction steps, and root-cause analysis. It doesn't accept external code contributions or pull requests. Read its <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/docs/contributing.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">contribution guidelines (online)</a> for details.</p>"};
